		Text: References and links
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Links in a line
		Paragraph: With `Markup: markdown`, a part of a line becomes a link with `[text](target)`, to the same targets as `Link`. These links are underlined, and only the linked words are clickable. A styled part can be a link too.
